{"ch": 93, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "وَالضُّحٰی ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "By the growing brightness of the forenoon,", "w": ["by the growing brightness of the forenoon", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "وَالَّیۡلِ اِذَا سَجٰی ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "And <i>by</i> the night when it becomes still,", "w": ["and <i>by</i> the night", "when", "it becomes still", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "مَا وَدَّعَکَ رَبُّکَ وَمَا قَلٰی ؕ﴿۴﴾", "en": "Thy Lord has not forsaken thee, nor is He displeased <i>with thee</i>.", "w": ["not", "has forsaken thee", "Thy Lord", "nor", "is He displeased <i>with thee</i>", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "وَلَلۡاٰخِرَۃُ خَیۡرٌ لَّکَ مِنَ الۡاُوۡلٰی ؕ﴿۵﴾", "en": "Surely <i>every hour</i> that follows is better for thee than <i>the one</i> that precedes.", "w": ["surely <i>every hour</i> that follows", "is better", "for thee", "than", "<i>the one</i> that precedes", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "وَلَسَوۡفَ یُعۡطِیۡکَ رَبُّکَ فَتَرۡضٰی ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "And thy Lord will soon give thee and thou wilt be well pleased.", "w": ["and soon", "will give thee", "thy Lord", "and thou wilt be well pleased", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "اَلَمۡ یَجِدۡکَ یَتِیۡمًا فَاٰوٰی ۪﴿۷﴾", "en": "Did He not find thee an orphan and give <i>thee</i> shelter?", "w": ["did not", "He find thee", "an orphan", "and give <i>thee</i> shelter", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "وَوَجَدَکَ ضَآلًّا فَہَدٰی ۪﴿۸﴾", "en": "And He found thee wandering in search <i>for Him</i> and guided thee <i>unto Himself</i>.", "w": ["and He found thee", "wandering in search <i>for Him</i>", "and guided thee <i>unto Himself</i>", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "وَوَجَدَکَ عَآئِلًا فَاَغۡنٰی ؕ﴿۹﴾", "en": "And He found thee in want and enriched <i>thee</i>.", "w": ["and He found thee", "in want", "and enriched <i>thee</i>", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "فَاَمَّا الۡیَتِیۡمَ فَلَا تَقۡہَرۡ ؕ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "So the orphan, oppress not,", "w": ["so", "the orphan", "not", "oppress", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "وَاَمَّا السَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنۡہَرۡ ﴿ؕ۱۱﴾", "en": "[✲]And him who seeks <i>thy help</i>, chide not,", "w": ["and him", "who seeks <i>thy help</i>", "not", "chide", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "وَاَمَّا بِنِعۡمَۃِ رَبِّکَ فَحَدِّثۡ ﴿٪۱۲﴾", "en": "[✲]And the bounty of thy Lord, proclaim.", "w": ["and", "the bounty", "of thy Lord", "proclaim", ""]}]}